        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5f307b57-55e8-4f56-97f3-397df9e3dd96).Image",
        "Description": "I trust you will need no introduction to the self-proclaimed BBQ King. A master chef whose burgers are second to only his own unfortunately forgetful nature, he would very much appreciate it if you were to obtain him a flask of propane for his party. Of course, we have been tasked with eliminating him as well as his suspected cabal of sinister cohorts, though our client would request that we make sure to make certain to make each one look like an accident. No sense stirring the nest, eh 47?",
